  "content": "# 第41题\n\n**题型**: 解答题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n41. Why is it that“the older you are， the more likely you will come to a resolution after an argument”？\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nBecause more life experience usually leads to more defined priorities, and you are more likely to distinguish between what matters and what does not.\n\n",
  "answer": "My favorite book is 'The Old Man and the Sea' by Ernest Hemingway. It tells the story of an old fisherman who fights with a giant fish. I like it because it shows courage and never giving up. The old man's spirit inspires me to face difficulties bravely.",
  "analysis": "本题要求介绍最喜欢的书。要点：书名、作者、主要内容、喜欢原因。注意时态用一般现在时，人称用I。评分标准：内容完整4分，语言准确3分，逻辑连贯2分，书写规范1分。"
